<title>INDIA: India's Ballarpur 1996/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>India's Ballarpur 1996/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		380   vs   1,024.8</p>
<p>    Turnover	     13,436.2 vs  14,412.66</p>
<p>    Gross profit	    782.6 vs   1,374.91</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    391.5 vs     350.07</p>
<p>    Provision for MAT	11.0 vs	nil</p>
<p>Note: Ballarpur Industries Ltd is a leading Indian paper manufacturer. MAT refers to minimum alternate tax.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
